  "text": "I am the same person who commented immediately below.\nI forgot to add that this is the only drug, including beta blockers, that has ever slowed my heart rate down to a reasonable level.\nI have been EKG'd, ultrasounded, had my thyroid checked, wore portable monitors and cardiologist\ncould never find out why my heart was fast & would palpitate.\n50mg.\nToprol XL did NOTHING for me,\nnot even 100mg.\nToprol did anything except wipe me out.\nWithin two days of taking Cymbalta my heart rate slowed into the low 60's beat per minute resting rate, and it no longer races.\nHuge benefit for me.\n",
